Reflection (Week 3)
Week 3 provided a practical approach to categorising system workloads. Predicting resource usage helps identify potential bottlenecks in CPU, memory, disk, and network subsystems before actual testing.
Careful planning ensures monitoring scripts and performance evaluations will be meaningful, reproducible, and aligned with the security-hardened environment prepared in previous weeks.
